On Saturday, 29 April 2017 17:09:11 UTC+10, Vincent van Hees wrote:

> Dear Taren,
> This issue should now be addressed in version 1.5-3 I uploaded last night.
> If you are working in Windows then please wait a couple of days as Windows binaries need to be compiled by CRAN before they become active.
